<view class="page safe-bottom"><text class="eyebrow">OFFLINE STUDIO · NANJING</text><text class="title">오프라인에서 완성하는 이미지 디자인</text><text class="zh">在线下完成更完整的个人形象设计</text><scroll-view class="services" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="false"><view class="service" wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="ko"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text>{{item.ko}}</text><text>{{item.zh}}</text></view></scroll-view><view class="team"><text class="eyebrow">FOUNDING TEAM</text><text class="team-title">세 명의 창립자</text><text class="zh">三位创始人，共同完成专业与运营</text><view wx:for="{{founders}}" wx:key="en" class="founder"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" style="object-position:{{item.position}}"/><view class="bio"><text class="en">{{item.en}}</text><text class="name">{{item.ko}} · {{item.zh}}</text><text class="copy">{{item.copy}}</text></view></view></view></view>
